  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/393/terralith.png\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2><p>這個模組讓 Terralith 與動態樹木相容，在世界生成時為其生態域添加動態生長的樹木。<br>樹木、它們的行為和生成方式可透過樹木包進行自訂與調整。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>特色</strong></strong></h2><h4><strong>世界生成&nbsp;</strong></h4><p>所有 Terralith 生態域都會生成自訂樹木，數量多到無法一一列舉！以下是生態域現在樣貌的幾個範例：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/676/screenshot_2023-08-07_195732.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"361\"></p><p>盾地</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/678/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"358\"></p><p>櫻花林</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/680/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"396\"></p><p>紫水晶雨林</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/682/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"375\"></p><p>冬季與秋季天空群島</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/688/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"883\" height=\"458\"></p><p>高山高地</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/691/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"883\" height=\"465\"></p><p>森林高地</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>還有更多更多！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>其他附加元件</strong></strong></h2><p>動態樹木的其他模組附加元件可在<a href=\"https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木 Wiki</a> 找到。</p><h4><strong>建議與請求：</strong></h4><p>若想請求新的相容性模組，請在此處提出！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>需求</strong></strong></h2><p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 動態樹木<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Terralith</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>授權與模組包</strong></h2><p>你可以在任何模組包中使用此內容！無需詢問。<br>此模組採用 <strong>MIT</strong> 授權，原始碼公開於 Github 上。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
